{"id":"expl:packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts@L1","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts","span":{"start":1,"end":11}},"file":"packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts","span":{"start":1,"end":11},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:42c7e60f2d40832aecfbc7ebdcffbd5c025b572f544436410f3a60ba1754b51f","meta":{"text":"Enricher — optional, opt-in, and NEVER on the deterministic verb path.\nResearch §4.1: MCP `sampling/createMessage` was deprecated (SEP-2577, protocol 2026-07-28), so\nenrichment is designed around a DIRECT LLM provider API as the primary mechanism (env-configured\nkey), with a capability-gated sampling fallback kept only for the 12-month transition window and\nmarked deprecated. Outputs are tagged INFERRED and capped — they can never outrank EXTRACTED.\nThis is a scaffold: it declares availability from the environment and exposes the operations\n(cluster labels, NL→query, explanation summaries) the pipeline/verbs will call lazily at M7+."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts@L26","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts","span":{"start":26,"end":26}},"file":"packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts","span":{"start":26,"end":26},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:b316a8398dcee7838a95ae28afa6c62b4e62a084bbc0c0d4033a7108f8d9e0ab","meta":{"text":"True iff a direct provider key is configured (the primary, non-deprecated path)."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts@L31","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts","span":{"start":31,"end":35}},"file":"packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts","span":{"start":31,"end":35},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:d7dc1817fac3c289337cf4d7bfc2e197fcd8f7aaed3d095dee6a07a7cf7faa03","meta":{"text":"Enrich via the direct provider API. Returns undefined when unavailable (graceful degrade) — the\ndeterministic core continues without it. Real provider calls are wired at M7; the contract and\ngating live here now so nothing on the hot path ever reaches for an LLM."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts@L42","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts","span":{"start":42,"end":42}},"file":"packages/mcp/src/enrichment.ts","span":{"start":42,"end":42},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:460980a216c624df68321107985086351f3b984bd879302227a451d72f32cc5c","meta":{"text":"Build an Enricher from environment variables (KCRIB_LLM_API_KEY / KCRIB_LLM_PROVIDER / _MODEL)."}}
